        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For additional information about the risks to our business related to competition, see the section titled “Risk Factors—Risks Related to Our Business, Industry and Operations— We operate in highly competitive markets, and we face significant competition to attract and empower our creators and users.”",
        "start_character": 20304,
        "end_character": 20605
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001997859-26-000028",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001997859-26-000028-e87b6e26a3ac73d4",
        "accession_number": "0001997859-26-000028",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The majority of these adaptations are produced in partnership with third-party production companies in the form of a licensing agreement or in a limited pre-production capacity where we are paid a production fee for a service such as script development.",
        "start_character": 11676,
        "end_character": 11929
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001997859-26-000028",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001997859-26-000028-e87b6e26a3ac73d4",
        "accession_number": "0001997859-26-000028",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We operate our Company as a portfolio of small, vision-aligned teams.",
        "start_character": 38316,
        "end_character": 38385
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001997859-26-000028",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001997859-26-000028-e87b6e26a3ac73d4",
        "accession_number": "0001997859-26-000028",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We take a variety of technical and organizational security measures and other measures designed to protect our data, including personal information and other data pertaining to our creators, users, employees and business partners.",
        "start_character": 26365,
        "end_character": 26595
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001997859-26-000028",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001997859-26-000028-e87b6e26a3ac73d4",
        "accession_number": "0001997859-26-000028",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "•Shared Back-End: Because our platform consists of multiple mobile app offerings, we have designed certain back-end infrastructure to harmonize user-facing features across these apps.",
        "start_character": 13759,
        "end_character": 13942
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001997859-26-000028",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001997859-26-000028-e87b6e26a3ac73d4",
        "accession_number": "0001997859-26-000028",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Although we take reasonable efforts designed to comply with all applicable laws and regulations, there can be no assurance that we will not be subject to regulatory action, including fines, in the event of an incident.",
        "start_character": 26913,
        "end_character": 27131
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001997859-26-000028",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001997859-26-000028-e87b6e26a3ac73d4",
        "accession_number": "0001997859-26-000028",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Animation continues to be a major initiative for us, and we have recently announced that Amazon MGM Studios greenlit Lore Olympus to be developed into a new animated series in conjunction with The Jim Henson Company.",
        "start_character": 12451,
        "end_character": 12667
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001997859-26-000028",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001997859-26-000028-e87b6e26a3ac73d4",
        "accession_number": "0001997859-26-000028",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In addition, the application and interpretation of these laws and regulations are often uncertain, particularly in the new and rapidly evolving industry in which we operate.",
        "start_character": 21222,
        "end_character": 21395
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001997859-26-000028",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001997859-26-000028-e87b6e26a3ac73d4",
        "accession_number": "0001997859-26-000028",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Internally, we have an in-house team dedicated to developing and advancing this viewer technology.",
        "start_character": 15069,
        "end_character": 15167
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001997859-26-000028",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001997859-26-000028-e87b6e26a3ac73d4",
        "accession_number": "0001997859-26-000028",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Occasionally, we may choose to rely entirely on our in-house production capability to produce the adaptation, if we determine the potential reward to be substantially in excess of the investment risk and the magnitude of the required investment to be manageable.",
        "start_character": 12025,
        "end_character": 12287
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001997859-26-000028",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001997859-26-000028-e87b6e26a3ac73d4",
        "accession_number": "0001997859-26-000028",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We are also committed to the development of our team through leadership, technical and essential skills training.",
        "start_character": 38730,
        "end_character": 38843
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001997859-26-000028",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001997859-26-000028-e87b6e26a3ac73d4",
        "accession_number": "0001997859-26-000028",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We focused on the development of this type of digital content because this mode of storytelling is not only appealing to our users, but it is also well suited to the success of individual creators.",
